  "topic": "mf_doom",
  "ttsScript": "MF DOOM sent imposters to his own concerts. Fans paid for a mask and sometimes it wasn't him. People called it a gimmick. But Daniel Dumile had a deal at nineteen. Brother died. Label dropped him. Homeless. He came back masked. Not hiding. Armor. Viktor Vaughn. King Geedorah. Metal Fingers. No Grammy. No plaque. Kanye sampled him. Tyler worships him. He died October 2020. Family told no one until New Year's Eve. Even his death was a plot twist. ALL CAPS when you spell the man's name.",
